\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Expert streaming under a hard DRAM budget. For each token, the router selects experts whose weights must reside in a bounded DRAM expert-memory pool. The allocation/retention policy determines per-layer memory budgets and eviction decisions. Requests for non-resident experts trigger asynchronous direct reads from the NVMe expert store. The experiments characterize this coupled allocation-and-retention process through reuse, I/O volume, queue depth, token latency, and generation throughput.}}{4}{figure.caption.1}\protected@file@percent }
\providecommand*\caption@xref[2]{\@setref\relax\@undefined{#1}}
\newlabel{fig:architecture}{{1}{4}{Expert streaming under a hard DRAM budget. For each token, the router selects experts whose weights must reside in a bounded DRAM expert-memory pool. The allocation/retention policy determines per-layer memory budgets and eviction decisions. Requests for non-resident experts trigger asynchronous direct reads from the NVMe expert store. The experiments characterize this coupled allocation-and-retention process through reuse, I/O volume, queue depth, token latency, and generation throughput}{figure.caption.1}{}}
